"  Use                                                                                                                  │"
"  ───                                                                                          ╭ Outline ────────────╮ │"
"                                                                                               │                     │ │"
"  ▎ mido README.md          # open the viewer                                              sh  │  ▾ mido             │ │"
"  ▎ mido -                  # read Markdown from stdin                                         │  ├   Install        │ █"
"  ▎ mido -p README.md       # print styled text to stdout, pipe it to less -R                  │ ▎├   Use            │ █"
"  ▎ mido -w 80 notes.md     # cap the width (default: full terminal width)                     │  ├   Keys           │ █"
"                                                                                               │  └   What renders   │ █"
"  Piping without  -p  prints plain text, so  mido file.md > out.txt  never leaks escape        │                     │ █"
"  codes.                                                                                       ╰─────────────────────╯ █"
"                                                                                                                       █"
"                                                                                                                       █"
"  Keys                                                                                                                 │"
"  ────                                                                                                                 │"
"                                                                                                                       │"
"  ┌───────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┐                                            │"
"  │ Key                               │ Action                            │                                            │"
"  ┝━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┿━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┥                                            │"
"  │  j  /  k , arrows, wheel          │ Scroll one line                   │                                            │"
"  │  Ctrl-d  /  Ctrl-u                │ Half page                         │                                            │"
"  │  Ctrl-f  /  Ctrl-b ,  Space       │ Full page                         │                                            │"
"  │  g  /  G                          │ Top / bottom                      │                                            │"
"  │  b                                │ Toggle the outline panel          │                                            │"
"  │  Tab  /  Shift-Tab                │ Cycle focus between the panes     │                                            │"
"  │  Tab  then  ←  /  →               │ Move focus in that direction      │                                            │"
"  │  h  /  l                          │ Focus the outline / the document  │                                            │"
"  │  Space ,  h  /  l  in the outline │ Fold, collapse / expand a section │                                            │"
"  │  -  /  =  in the outline          │ Fold all / unfold all             │                                            │"
"  │  /  then  n  /  N                 │ Search, next, previous            │                                            │"
" stdin   outline: j/k follow  space fold  Tab back                                                  ? help  q quit  32% "
